# Everything chatq writes at runtime: the chat index, the queue (your prompts),
# run logs, the Join key. chat-index.csv holds absolute paths and every chat
# title on the box, and queue/ holds prompt text - private by nature, never to
# be published.
data/
# the test harness builds its fake homes here and deletes them afterwards
tests/.sandbox/
# what extension/build.js copies in before vsce packs the extension, and the
# package itself
extension/payload/
extension/CHANGELOG.md
extension/LICENSE
*.vsix
# personal Claude Code settings for this checkout (e.g. the auto-compact window)
.claude/settings.local.json
